 *                        non-cancelled, non-success conclusion is a verdict
 *                        word (sweep parity: the existing code treats every
 *                        `conclusion !== 'cancelled'` as sweepable).
 *   'zombie-cancelled' — newest concluded CANCELLED outside every grace —
